        "date": "2026-11-27",
        "summary": "Smart Portal developed by Direk Tech has a Missing Authorization vulnerability. Authenticated remote attackers can add a specified account to the Active Directory Domain Admins group, thereby obtaining domain administrator privileges.",
        "author": null
      },
      {
